@startuml
autonumber
actor Admin
actor User
participant "Identity Service" as Identity
participant "Legacy Monolith" as Monolith
database "Postgres (Security DB)" as DB
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Telemetry Service" as Telemetry
participant "WebSocket Service" as WS

== 1. Настройка инфраструктуры Админом ==
Admin -> Identity : POST /api/v1/houses\n(name, city, address)
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO houses
Identity --> Admin : House Created (ID: house_uuid)

Admin -> Identity : POST /api/v1/users (register)
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO users
Identity --> Admin : User Created (ID: user_uuid)

Admin -> Identity : POST /api/v1/houses/{id}/assign-user\n{user_id: user_uuid}
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO user_houses
note right: Связываем пользователя с домом
Identity --> Admin : Access Granted

== 2. Настройка устройств Пользователем ==
User -> Identity : POST /auth/login
Identity --> User : Auth Token

User -> Identity : POST /api/v1/houses/{id}/devices
note right: Указывает, какой модуль (device_id)\nстоит в этом доме
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO device_ownership\n(device_id, house_id, auth_key)
Identity --> User : Device Linked to House

== 3. Эксплуатация и мониторинг ==
entity "IoT Sensor" as Sensor
Sensor -> MQTT : pub: device/telemetry\n{device_id, value, auth_key}

MQTT -> Telemetry : Dispatch message
Telemetry -> Identity : GET /validate/device/{id}
Identity -> DB : SELECT house_id, auth_key\nFROM device_ownership
Identity --> Telemetry : Valid (House: "Green St. 10")

Telemetry -> Monolith : PATCH /sensors/{id}
Monolith -> DB : UPDATE sensors
Monolith --> Telemetry : OK

Telemetry -> MQTT : pub: internal/notify
MQTT -> WS : Forward update
WS -> User : WebSocket: {data, house_info}
@enduml